<chapter xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude"  xml:id="chapter-4-intro">
  <title>Week 4</title>
  <introduction>

    <p>
      At the end of this week you should be able to...
    </p>
    <objectives>
      <ul>
        <li>use a REPL to evaluate boolean expressions and conditional statements</li>
        <li>identify type errors with expressions involving boolean operators and comparison operators</li>
        <li>trace the flow of control during the execution of a program using conditional statements (if/switch)</li>
        <li>develop programs that use conditional statements (if/switch)</li>
        <li>apply pair-programming to simple problem solving</li>
      </ul>
    </objectives>
  </introduction>
  
  
  <xi:include href="sec-boolean-values.ptx"/>
  <xi:include href="sec-conditional-statements.ptx"/>
</chapter>

